<div class="phead"><div class="wrap"><p class="kick">Drawing sets · 2019—2026</p><h1>The index</h1><p>Every project is listed, including the ones still on paper. Status is honest: if it says drawing set, nobody lives there yet.</p></div></div><section class="sec"><div class="wrap">{%- assign ps=get_content_items(ContentType="projects",OrderBy="sort_order asc",PageSize=50)-%}{% for p in ps.Items %}{%- assign x=p.PublishedContent -%}<a class="row" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}"><div><b>{{ x.drawing_no }}</b><br>{{ x.year }}</div><div><b>{{ p.PrimaryField }}</b><br><span class="meta">{{ x.location }} · {{ x.kind }} · {{ x.materials }}</span><p>{{ x.summary }}</p></div><div>{%- capture st -%}{{ x.status }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if st contains "on_boards" %}ON THE BOARDS{% elsif st contains "drawing" %}DRAWING SET{% else %}BUILT{% endif %}<br>{{ x.budget }}</div><div><img src="{{ x.image.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt=""></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
